Day 03 – AWS Subnet Creation

Task

Create a subnet inside an existing AWS VPC.

Configuration

- VPC CIDR: "172.31.0.0/16"
- Subnet Name: "datacenter-subnet"
- Subnet CIDR: "172.31.96.0/20"

Problem Faced

- CIDR address outside the VPC range.
- CIDR overlap with existing subnets.

Troubleshooting

- Checked existing subnet CIDR ranges.
- Identified an unused IP range.
- Selected "172.31.96.0/20".
- Successfully created the subnet.

What I Learned

- AWS VPC and Subnets.
- CIDR notation.
- CIDR overlap troubleshooting.

Status: Completed
